    {
      "tag": "SUMMARY",
      "id": "",
      "text": "03\nSelect the deadline by composition purpose\nStatus observation keeps 100 ms; ordinary exchanges keep 250 ms. Socket tests invert small/large budgets to expose purpose selection; ",
