    },
    {
      "tag": "SUMMARY",
      "id": "",
      "text": "12\nMake registry ownership equality authoritative\nStartup decisions delegate to one predicate with narrow coordinate expectations. Tests force the predicate to deny ownership and v",
      "href": null,
      "type": null,
      "visible": true
    },
    {
      "tag": "A",
