    {
      "tag": "SUMMARY",
      "id": "",
      "text": "15\nOwn daemon time sources, but scan only one directory\nMechanisms use a daemon wall/monotonic clock. The new test titled “outside daemon mechanisms” scans only sibling files in li",
      "href": null,
      "type": null,
      "visible": true
